silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_02_yoneda_corner_concrete_anchor_2_P_visit_1_#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode2 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode2 is the population set P(visit_1) of vet records observed at Mittens' first weekly check-up time-point, concretely body-mass 4.1 kg and Alice-as-owner records. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'P(visit_1)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
